# Line-ending policy. Keep in sync with .editorconfig.
# Git stores all text as LF and every checkout materializes LF, so agent
# tools, Visual Studio, and fresh worktrees produce identical bytes. This
# keeps WorktreeCli's raw-byte plan comparison (PlanScheduler.cpp
# claim-next) deterministic across checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never normalize. text=auto already auto-detects these; the
# explicit marks are belt-and-suspenders covering every tracked binary type.
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.tga       binary
*.ktx       binary
*.wav       binary
*.otf       binary
*.bin       binary
*.docx      binary
*.MODEL     binary
*.PreExport binary
# Data-packer intermediate texture/model assets (uppercase, underscored).
*.BC4_UNORM_BLOCK     binary
*.BC5_UNORM_BLOCK     binary
*.BC7_UNORM_BLOCK     binary
*.R16G16B16A16_SFLOAT binary
*.GLTF_MODEL          binary
